    description: "Add mypy to dev dependencies and bootstrap a basic [tool.mypy] section in pyproject.toml. Goal: zero-friction first-run that produces actionable output without overwhelming the team. Use `basic` mode equivalent: python_version=\"3.10\", ignore_missing_imports=True initially (later carve out per-import); no_implicit_optional=True; warn_unused_configs=True. Do NOT enable strict mode in this PR (that's W4). Verify mypy runs cleanly on at least one package's src tree without errors that aren't true bugs. Blocks all downstream mypy_adoption items."  # daac
